Z||000009||StuGood||05-31-2001||11:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MrFeeArrow:<BR><B>...Last year I checked and most places here in north Florida wanted $1800.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, I guess I'd want that, too, if I could get it.  For $1800, sounds as if you could drive to south Georgia (or wherever you have to go), to get the conversion done by someone who knows what they're doing <B>and</B> charges a reasonable fee.  <P>These aircraft engineers, they don't know anything  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  By the way, I like your screen name - but how do you pronounce it, Ferraro?  Fe-arr-o?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Enough ribbing.  Sounds like you might want to shop around some more.  I'll be facing the same situation soon, so I'll be interested in the results. Good luck with it, and stay cool  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  ||||reg||12
